  << /ActualText (\240Strictly speaking\054 STO \050Security Token Offering\051 refers to the act of issuing security tokens \024 analogous to an IPO \024 while the tokens themselves are more precisely termed STs \050Security Tokens\051\056 In practice\054 however\054 \042STO\042 has become the shorthand used across Korea\047s industry and financial press to refer to the broader market\054 products\054 and ecosystem\056 This report follows that convention\056)
