11349 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Gangnam apartment tokenization is not an abstract concept\056 This chapter works through three concrete scenarios \024 each reflecting a different owner profile and purpose \024 to show how tokenization might actually be structured in practice\056 The first is a residential\055financial hybrid\054 where an existing owner monetizes a portion of their equity while retaining the right to live in the apartment\056 The second is a partnership model\054 where a buyer short on funds raises the shortfall through equity investment rather than debt\056 The third is a co\055investment model\054 where a group of investors collectively purchases an apartment unit together\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
