11370 0 obj
  << /ActualText (A drag\055along right is a contractual clause that allows a majority owner to compel minority stakeholders to join in the sale of an asset on the same terms\056 It protects the majority owner\047s ability to complete a clean exit without minority holders blocking or delaying the transaction\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 11371 0 R
