  << /ActualText (The third model is collective ownership\072 ten investors each contribute 1 billion won \050approximately \044720\054000 USD\051 to jointly acquire a 10 billion won apartment unit through an SPV \050special purpose vehicle\051 or trust\056 They receive rental income as dividends and share in the capital gain at the time of sale\056 The infrastructure for democratic decision\055making \024 tenant selection\054 sale timing \024 via smart contract already exists technically\056\n\nIn practice\054 however\054 this model runs headlong into Korea\047s punitive corporate property tax regime\056 Under the Local Tax Act\054vii a corporation acquiring a residential property is subject to a 12 percent acquisition tax \024 compared to roughly 3 percent for an individual buyer\056 Under the Comprehensive Real       \052\052\052\052)
