11551 0 obj
  << /ActualText (cornered listings and orchestrated price movements\056 The state\054 running as ever to catch up\054 passed the Real Estate Brokerage Actxx in 1983\054 replacing the informal notification\055based brokerage system with a licensing regime and introducing the certified real estate agent qualification\056\n\nThe pattern repeated itself without variation\056 The land speculation fever of the late 1980s produced the three Land Public Concept Acts of 1989\056 Nominee transaction practices produced the Real Estate Real\055Name Act of 1995\056 The multi\055property ownership boom produced the Comprehensive Real Estate Taxxxi in 2005\056 The gap investment craze produced the Three Tenancy Acts of 2020\056 In each case\054 market energy moved first\073 the law arrived to clean up afterward\056)
